## AdvancedAuctionApi

### Get item bid options (POST)
## Get item bid options (POST)
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/advanced_auction/items/get?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "catalog_id": "<string>",
 "items": "<string>"
}


### Operate on item level bid options
## Operate on item level bid options
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/advanced_auction/items/submit?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "catalog_id": "<string>",
 "items": "<string>"
}

